=[ Nitium ]

Web browser powered by Servo and Slint, built with the Origiri Frameworks.

==[ Overview ]

Nitium is a modern, responsive desktop web browser that embeds Mozilla's Servo browser engine inside Slint UI with Vulkan/WGPU rendering integration.

==[ Workspace Layout ]

-| @dir(apps/desktop) (`nitium-desktop`) -- Desktop application binary wiring `nitium-desktop-shell` and `nitium-webview`.
-| @dir(apps/desktop-shell) (`nitium-desktop-shell`) -- Desktop Slint UI shell (`AppWindow`).
-| @dir(apps/android) (`nitium-android`) -- Android application package wiring `nitium-android-shell` and Slint Android backend.
-| @dir(apps/android-shell) (`nitium-android-shell`) -- Android Slint UI shell (`MobileAppWindow`).
-| @dir(crates/nitium-core) (`nitium-core`) -- Pure Rust domain logic with zero Servo or Slint dependencies (address input, tabs, shortcuts, controls, bookmarks, history, session, find, zoom, IME).
-| @dir(crates/nitium-settings) (`nitium-settings`) -- User settings, search presets, validation, and storage.
-| @dir(crates/nitium-shell) (`nitium-shell`) -- Slint UI shell common abstractions and `BrowserApp` state management (zero Servo dependency).
-| @dir(crates/nitium-webview) (`nitium-webview`) -- Servo 0.7 browser engine integration and WGPU/Surfman rendering bridge.

==[ Building and Running ]

===[ Prerequisites ]

-| Rust stable (2024 edition, 1.88+)
-| Wayland / X11 graphics libraries (`libxkbcommon`, `fontconfig`, `wayland`, `vulkan-loader`, `mesa`, `libGL`)
-| Or use Nix: `nix develop`

===[ Run Application ]

```bash
cargo run -p nitium-desktop
```

===[ Android APK ]

```bash
just apk-arm  # Real devices (aarch64)
just apk-x86  # Emulator (x86_64)
```

===[ Fast Check & Tests (No Servo Build) ]

```bash
just check-fast
just test-fast
```
